in</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1141469-september-update-check-out-the-devas?p=1143207#post1143207\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It may be because he could also be considered a member of the Yazata.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whoa, seriously? What's his name as a Yazata then?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12342-dr-quantum","name":"Dr. Quantum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T08:57:42-07:00","id":1143242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dr. Quantum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1141469-september-update-check-out-the-devas?p=1143233#post1143233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Whoa, seriously? What's his name as a Yazata then?</div> </div> </div> </div>Going by Wikipedia, he uses some of the same names he uses with the Deva - Vayu, Vata, Vayu-Vata or Vata-Vayu (Vayu and Vata have similar meanings in Sanskrit and Avestan). He also has much the same dominion, overseeing the wind and atmosphere.<br /> <br /> Zoroastarianism considers him both <i>yazata</i>, in the sense of 'worthy of worship', and <i>daeva</i>.<br /> <br /> On a first glance, I know I'd certainly suspect he's a member of both pantheons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":51,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","user":"marin","date":". 09-23-2017, 12:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T09:34:43-07:00","id":1143250,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1141469-september-update-check-out-the-devas?p=1143242#post1143242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Going by Wikipedia, he uses some of the same names he uses with the Deva - Vayu, Vata, Vayu-Vata or Vata-Vayu (Vayu and Vata have similar meanings in Sanskrit and Avestan). He also has much the same dominion, overseeing the wind and atmosphere.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, I'm almost tempted to give him Trickster and/or Deception associated just for somehow managing to pull that off.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1141469-september-update-check-out-the-devas?p=1143242#post1143242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Zoroastarianism considers him both <i>yazata</i>, in the sense of 'worthy of worship', and <i>daeva</i>.<br /> <br /> On a first glance, I know I'd certainly suspect he's a member of both pantheons.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm eagerly awaiting the Companion just to see the Yazata write-up, and to see how all the cross-pantheon transplants are handled (I mean I know they'll be handled mechanically by Mantles or the like, but how do they exist in a World where both Pantheons are true... does each Mantle of Vayu hate the other? Do they know another one of their selves is working for the enemy, or are they double agents for one or the other Pantheon?)<br /> <br /> And that's not even getting into the Questions of whether Varuna has a Primordial Mantle he puts on sometimes or if Ahura Mazda is an entirely seperate deity in the World... and what do the two Pantheons do about Soma/Haoma? Who is crucially important to both religions but is also very very much a Titan... and these two aren't the most Titan friendly Pantheons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1344-samudra","name":"Samudra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1344_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"497"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T10:07:14-07:00","id":1143262,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samudra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1141469-september-update-check-out-the-devas?p=1143250#post1143250\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm eagerly awaiting the Companion just to see the Yazata write-up, and to see how all the cross-pantheon transplants are handled (I mean I know they'll be handled mechanically by Mantles or the like, but how do they exist in a World where both Pantheons are true... does each Mantle of Vayu hate the other? Do they know another one of their selves is working for the enemy, or are they double agents for one or the other Pantheon?)</div> </div> </div> </div>It may be he's just one of those gods who belong to multiple pantheons, no Mantles needed (cf. Yamaraja). Even so, how on Earth does <i>anyone</i> manage to pull off being a member of <i>those </i>two pantheons simultaneously?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T10:24:54-07:00","id":1143269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1141469-september-update-check-out-the-devas?p=1143262#post1143262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It may be he's just one of those gods who belong to multiple pantheons, no Mantles needed (cf. Yamaraja). Even so, how on Earth does <i>anyone</i> manage to pull off being a member of <i>those </i>two pant