"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T14:51:55-07:00","id":1143331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1141469-september-update-check-out-the-devas?p=1143319#post1143319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh look, Samudra's Kali write-up disappeared! I wonder what that means <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The forum is haunted???<br /> :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T15:48:27-07:00","id":1143341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samudra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1141469-september-update-check-out-the-devas?p=1141829#post1141829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of which, I meant to discuss this earlier but it completely slipped my mind... but I prefer to treat the Puranic Chandra and the Vedic as either separate deities or significantly different Mantles of the same deity... Soma in the Vedas is primarily associated with the Soma plant, with his Lunar associations being a distant second... he IS a Moon God, but that's barely mentioned and/or relevant to the Vedas, which are significantly more interested in the Sun.<br /> <br /> Chandra, on the other hand, is a Moon God first and foremost, and a God of astrology and the calendar... he has minimal associations with Soma, though he came out of the same Churning of the Oceans Episode as Amrita. They are treated as the same God, with Chandra being called Soma and Soma being a byword for Moon, but to be perfectly honest Soma is practically Titanic in the Vedas... concerned only with his Plant self and it's properties and use in sacrifice... which should surprise no one since Soma of the Deva and Haoma of the Ahura are probably the same person (even if the plant they represent might not have been). Chandra by contrast is a lively figure who is a ladies man, being married to the 27 lunar asterisms and carrying on a torrid affair with the wife of Brihaspati, with whom he had the Planet Mercury as a son.<br /> <br /> So yeah, if I were designing it, I'd treat Soma as a Titan of Fertility and Moon, with possibly Deception (for the possible hallucinogenic effects of Soma) and Chandra as a God with Lover, Sage and Healer as Callings, and Moon, Fortune, Order and Health as Purviews.</div> </div> </div> </div>A god who has massively changed over time sounds like exactly what Mantles exist for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T08:35:00-07:00","id":1143467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noneofyourbusiness</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where can I find the link?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/scion-2nd-edition-tabletop-rpg/posts/1991792?ref=activity\" target=\"_blank\">Kickstarter Update #52</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T08:50:12-07:00","id":1143474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1141469-september-update-check-out-the-devas?p=1143341#post1143341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A god who has massively changed over time sounds like exactly what Mantles exist for.</div> </div> </div> </div>True... I can see Chandra, Soma and Haoma as three Mantles of the same Deity... I'm just not sure yet if a God can have a Titanic Mantle (and vice versa).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1344-samudra","name":"Samudra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1344_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"497"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T09:10:54-07:00","id":1143479,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samudra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1141469-september-update-check-out-the-devas?p=1143474#post1143474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> True... I can see Chandra, Soma and Haoma as three Mantles of the same Deity... I'm just not sure yet if a God can have a Titanic Mantle (and vice versa).</div> </div> </div> </div>Could just be he was a Titan in the Vedic era, but became a god over time, perhaps the older Titan Soma dividing into a Yazata (Haoma) and a Deva (Chandra).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"u